# Founder's Note 0003 — Purpose Before Possibility

## Observation

Directories should be created when they have a purpose, not when they have a possibility.

## Honest Inspection

Ask:

> "If this directory were removed today, would the engineer lose understanding?"

If the answer is **no**, the directory has not yet earned its place.

## Measure of Success

If every directory carries its own purpose, the structure will remain clear regardless of
how large the project becomes.
